## 🔑 Managing Gemini API Keys

### Get Free API Keys

Visit https://ai.google.dev and click "Get API Key"

**Free Tier Benefits:**
- ✅ 60 API keys maximum
- ✅ Never expires
- ✅ Free to use
- ✅ No credit card required

### Add Multiple Keys for Reliability

The system automatically rotates through your keys:

```env
GEMINI_API_KEYS=key1,key2,key3,key4,key5
```

**Benefits:**
- If one key hits rate limit, it uses the next one
- Round-robin rotation ensures even distribution
- No downtime when keys rotate

### Monitor API Usage

Add monitoring endpoint to check active keys:
```bash
curl https://aurora-qa-system.onrender.com/api/stats
```

Response shows number of loaded API keys:
```json
{
  "api_keys_loaded": 5,
  "status": "ready"
}
```

